  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: [V(XI) - city - 2]. This deme -\u00a0Eitea (Akamantis) - should not be confused with the similarly named <a class=\"internal-link\" href=\"resolveuid/f1e0311173bd432abbb0ceac89d82ce5\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Eitea (Antiochis)</a>.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Eitea was a deme of the tribe Akamantis, located in Attica. It is attested by literary and documentary sources, but its precise location cannot be determined today",
